Package: tamil-phonetic-keyboard
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ibus, ibus-m17n, ibus-gtk, ibus-gtk3, dconf-gsettings-backend | gsettings-backend
Description: Tamil Phonetic keyboard layout for IBus (GNOME X11 only)
 This package installs and configures the Tamil Phonetic keyboard layout
 for IBus input method framework on GNOME desktop with X11 session.
 It automatically sets up the keyboard layout and configures the system to use it.
 .
 This package only supports GNOME desktop environment with X11 display server.
 For other desktop environments or Wayland, manual configuration is required.
 .
 After installation, Tamil Phonetic keyboard will be available in your input
 method settings.

